:: Poppy Flats Gifts
<<effects>><<run poppySchedule()>><<set $outside to 0>><<speechresolve>>
<<set _giftData to setup.foodstuff[$gift]>>
<<if !_giftData>>
	<span class="red">Something goes wrong</span> as you try to hand Poppy the gift.
	<br><br>
	<<poppyOpiumPulse>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<handheldon>>
	<<poppyFlatsMenu>>
<<else>>
	<<set _gift to _giftData.name + (_giftData.food?.handheld_gift ? " gift" : "")>><<wearProp _gift>>
	<<if T.poppyStatus and T.poppyStatus.includes("LowPatience")>>
		Poppy glances at the gift in your hands, then pointedly looks away.
		<br><br>
		"I'm not in the mood for gifts right now," <<he>> says flatly.
		<<poppyOpiumPulse>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<handheldon>>
		<<poppyFlatsMenu>>
	<<else>>
		<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
			"I-I made you a gift," you say, holding it out before you can lose your nerve. "I hope you like it."
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
			"I made this for you," you say softly, offering it with both hands. "I hope it's all right."
		<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
			"I've brought you a little gift," you say, presenting it as neatly as you can. "I hope it suits your taste."
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
			"I made you something," you say, holding it out with a small smile. "You'll like it."
		<<else>>
			"I've made you a gift," you say. "I hope you like it."
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<if ["jammie_dodger", "rich_biscuit", "quiche"].includes($gift)>>
			Before you can hold out the <<recipe_name $gift>>, Poppy's already giving you a knowing smirk. "I could smell it from a mile away."
			<br><br>
			When you present the <<recipe_name $gift>> to <<him>>, <<he>> thanks you as <<he>> takes it from your hand.
			<br><br>
			Poppy takes a bite and groans in delight as the food hits <<his>> tastebuds. "This is delicious! How'd you know this is my favourite?"<<gglove>><<npcincr Poppy love 3>><<saveFavoriteFood "Poppy" $gift>><<if T.poppyLustUnlocked>><<glust>><<npcincr Poppy lust 2>><</if>>
			<<earnFeat "Hungry Fox">>
		<<elseif $gift is "valentines_chocolate" and $valentines>>
			<<earnFeat "Be My Valentine">>
			You take out the box of Valentine's Day chocolate you made, and hold it out to Poppy.
			<br><br>
			Poppy gasps. "For me?! Oh my~" <<He>> takes the box from you.
			<br><br>
			"Happy Valentine's Day," You smile. "I made them myself."
			<br><br>
			You watch as Poppy opens the box and pops a chocolate into <<his>> mouth. As soon as <<he>> bites into it, a big smile forms on <<his>> lips. "These are way better than those overpriced chocolates you can find in stores.
			<<if Number($poppyromance) gte 0>>
				Thank you, my jewel."
				<br><br>
				Poppy leans in and gives you a kiss on the cheek. <<lstress>><<stress -5>><<ltrauma>><<trauma -3>><<arousal 250>><<garousal>>
			<<else>>
				Thank you."
				<br><br>
				Poppy wraps <<his>> arms around you and gives you a tight hug. <<lstress>><<stress -5>>
			<</if>>
		<<elseif setup.foodstuff[$gift].food.tags.includes("drink")>>
			You hold out the <<recipe_name $gift>>. Poppy's eyes widen in surprise. <<He>> quickly recovers and takes the drink from your hands with a smile.
			<br><br>
			"Oh my, this smells wonderful! Did you make this yourself?" Poppy takes a sip and hums in appreciation. "Delicious... thank you for sharing this with me."<<glove>><<npcincr Poppy love 1>>
		<<else>>
			You hold out the <<recipe_name $gift>>. Poppy's eyes widen in surprise. <<He>> quickly recovers and takes the food from your hands with a smile.
			<br><br>
			"Oh my, this looks delicious! Did you make this yourself?" Poppy takes a bite and nods as <<he>> chews. "Yummy... thank you for sharing this with me."<<glove>><<npcincr Poppy love 1>>
		<</if>>
		<<poppyOpiumPulse>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<handheldon>>
		<<poppyFlatsMenu>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

