/* ============================================================
   LIPSTICK EVENT
   ============================================================ */
:: Flats Poppy Lipstick Event
<<set $location to "flats">><<set $bus to "poppy_living_room">><<set $outside to 0>>
<<effects>><<run poppySchedule()>><<speechresolve>>
<<set $poppySeen.push("flat_lipstick_event")>>
You are in the living room. You see Poppy sitting on the couch with a tube of lipstick and mirror in hand. You also see multiple tubes of lipstick on top of the coffee table.
<br><br>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"What are you up to?" you ask, sitting beside Poppy with a curious glance at the lipstick.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"May I ask what you're up to?" you say as you sit down beside Poppy, eyeing the colourful little collection.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"What are you plotting with all that lipstick?" you ask as you sit down beside Poppy.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"That's a lot of lipstick," you say as you sit down beside Poppy. "Please tell me this is going somewhere interesting."
<<else>>
	"What are you up to?" you ask as you sit down beside Poppy.
<</if>>
<br><br>
"Testing out some new lipsticks I bought." <<He>> smiles at you. "I couldn't decide which one I wanted or which fit me better so I just bought them all." <<He>> shrugs and applies lipstick onto <<his>> lips.
<br><br>
"Now that you're here, how about we do an experiment?" Poppy turns to you with a sly grin. "Let's see which lipstick is kiss proof." <<He>> pulls you closer by the chin and kisses you on the lips.<<garousal>><<arousal 300>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Flats Poppy Lipstick Event 2]]>><</link>>

:: Flats Poppy Lipstick Event 2
<<effects>><<speechresolve>>
When Poppy pulls away, <<he>> looks at you and pouts. "What a shame, it's not kiss proof. I liked this shade." <<He>> wipes <<his>> lips off with a tissue and starts applying another tube of lipstick. The process went on for awhile. Apply, kiss, wipe and repeat.
<br><br>
By the time Poppy is done, you are a blushing mess with your face and neck covered in lipstick marks. "At least there's some that are kiss proof. My money didn't go to waste after all. I didn't bore you with my experiment, did I?" <<He>> asks in a coy tone.
<br><br>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	You shake your head quickly, cheeks still warm. "Not at all," you say with a nervous grin. "I enjoyed it."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You shake your head, smiling up at Poppy. "Not at all," you say softly. "I enjoyed it."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	You shake your head, trying to look dignified beneath the lipstick marks. "It was a very thorough experiment."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	You shake your head, grin widening. "Not at all. You can test the next batch on me too."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	You shake your head, pretending the blush on your face means nothing. "...I've survived worse experiments."
<<else>>
	You shake your head furiously. "Not at all, I enjoyed it," you say with a lopsided grin.
<</if>>
<br><br>
Poppy chuckles. "<<goodGirl>>." <<He>> kisses you on the lips before releasing you.
<<poppyOpiumPulse>><<set $eventskip to 1>>
<<poppyFlatsMenu>>

