		Poppy stretches and yawns as <<he>> gets up from bed. <<if !(T.poppyStatus and T.poppyStatus.includes("LowPatience"))>>"Morning <<= playerPronoun() is "m" ? "handsome" : playerPronoun() is "f" ? "beautiful" : "gorgeous">>. <span class="green">I'll go make breakfast</span>..."<</if>>
