:: Flats Poppy Sleep
<<run poppySchedule()>><<set $outside to 0>>
<<set _autosavehere to true>><<sleep>><<effects>>
<<if $wraith and $wraith.nightmare is 2 and Time.isBloodMoon() and !T.poppyFlatBaileyDue and _poppy_interrupt isnot "sex">>
	<<sleepeffects>>
	You dream of a beautiful figure, cloaked in white, standing under the red moon. It has its arms spread out to you in a welcoming gesture. You can feel its gaze boring into your mind as you step closer.
	<br><br>
	It's surrounded by trees, all bending inwards, and floating above a lake. Everything moves around you, and you find yourself hanging above a large ruin. You can't breathe.
	<br><br>
	You slowly open your eyes, and sluggishly stand from the bed. <<if $poppyFlat.home and $poppyFlat.room is "bedroom">>You make sure not to wake Poppy.<</if>> Your ears are ringing.
	<br><br>
	<<storeon "bed" "wardrobe">><<wraithPossess "poppy_flat">>
	<span class="nextLink"><<link [[Walk.|Flats Poppy Bedroom]]>><<rainWraith>><</link>></span>
	<br>
<<else>>
<<sleepeffects>><<wakingEffects $sleepHoursTotal>>
<<if ["dryheaving","nausea"].includes(_wakingEffect)>>
	<br><br>
	You slept soundly, but now feel a little rough.
	<br><br>
<<elseif $nightmares gte 1 and $controlled is 0>>
	<<nightmareWake>>
<<else>>
	<<if ($specialClothesEffects.bimbo.total gte random(100,1000) || $specialClothesEffects.pimp.total gte random(100,1000)) or $arousal gte ($arousalmax / 10) * 9>>
		<<wetDream>>
	<<elseif !_wakingEffect>>
		You sleep soundly.
		<br><br>
	<<else>>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<<if T.poppyFlatBaileyDue>>
	<span class="red">A sharp knock at the front door stirs you fully awake.</span>
	<br><br>
	<<set $wardrobe_location to "wardrobe">><<wardrobeSelection true>><<radiooutfits>>
	<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[Get out of bed|Flats Poppy Bailey]]>><<set $daily.poppy.flatBaileySeenDay to Time.days>><<bedclotheson "bed">><<loadTempHairStyle>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<elseif _poppy_interrupt is "sex">>
	<<include "Flats Poppy Bed Sex Init">>
<<else>>
	<<if $poppyFlat.home and $poppyFlat.room is "bedroom">>
		Poppy lies beside you.
		<br><br>
	<<else>>
		<<if Time.hour lte 5>>
			You spread across the whole bed.
		<<elseif Time.hour lte 8>>
			Dawnlight filters through the curtains.
		<<elseif Time.hour lte 17>>
			The curtains keep the room dim.
		<<else>>
			The street is quiet outside.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
	<<set $wardrobe_location to "wardrobe">><<wardrobeSelection true>><<radiooutfits>>
	<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[Get out of bed|Flats Poppy Bedroom]]>><<bedclotheson "bed">><<loadTempHairStyle>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</if>>

:: Flats Poppy Medicine Drawer
<<set $location to "flats">><<set $bus to "poppy_bedroom">><<set $outside to 0>>
<<effects>><<run poppySchedule()>>
You slide open the medicine drawer. Inside are neatly organised bandages, disinfectant, and a few labelled bottles Poppy clearly keeps stocked for emergencies. The arrangement is so precise that you suspect Poppy would notice instantly if anything went missing.
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<<link [[Manage your pills|PillCollection]]>><<set $pillsExitPassage to "Flats Poppy Bedroom">><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Step away|Flats Poppy Bedroom]]>><</link>>

:: Flats Poppy Wardrobe [exitCheckBypass]
<<effects>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $wardrobe_location to "wardrobe">><<wardrobeSelection>>
You sort through your things in Poppy's room.
<div id="wardrobewear"><<wardrobewear>></div>
<div id="wardrobeExits"><<wardrobeExits>></div>
<<if $exposed lte 0>>
	<<link [[Close wardrobe|Flats Poppy Bedroom]]>><<cleanupOnWardrobeExit>><</link>>
<<elseif hasSexStat("exhibitionism", 5) or $exposed lte 1>>
	<<link [[Close wardrobe|Flats Poppy Bedroom]]>><<cleanupOnWardrobeExit>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="blue">You can't remain undressed like this!</span>
<</if>>
<<wardrobe>>

:: Flats Poppy Wall Grid Board
<<set $location to "flats">><<set $bus to "poppy_bedroom">><<set $outside to 0>>
<<effects>><<run poppySchedule()>>
You approach the wall grid board. 
<br><br>
It's filled with various photos of Poppy and <<his>> friends having fun together. A small sketched portrait of Poppy with a signature "Kmagi" on the corner is pinned on the top of the grid. Beside the sketch, there's a sticky note with cherry blossom stickers that reads "a potato with lore", and the line below it is "D.N.A. is inside all of us". 
<<if !$poppySeen.includes("flat_board_seen")>><br><br>You're not sure what it means.<</if>>
<br><br>
You glance to a corner of the grid to see a blurry picture of Bailey that's taken from the side. <<if !$poppySeen.includes("flat_board_seen")>>You wonder why Poppy has such a photo of your caretaker.<</if>> You look to another corner of the grid and see a little doodle of yourself with a heart drawn on the side.
<<if !$poppySeen.includes("flat_board_seen")>><<set $poppySeen.push("flat_board_seen")>><</if>>
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<<link [[Back|Flats Poppy Bedroom]]>><</link>>

/* ============================================================
   EXHAUSTION
   ============================================================ */
:: Flats Poppy Exhaustion Collapse
<<set $location to "flats">><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<run poppySchedule()>>
Your eyelids feel heavy and your vision blurs. You didn't realise that you've exhausted yourself. You collapse on the floor and pass out.
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<<link [[Next|Flats Poppy Exhaustion Wake]]>><<pass 60>><<tiredness -1800>><</link>>

:: Flats Poppy Exhaustion Wake
<<set $location to "flats">><<set $bus to "poppy_living_room">><<set $outside to 0>>
<<effects>><<run poppySchedule()>><<run markPoppyInteraction()>>
You wake up to find yourself on the couch in Poppy's living room. You don't remember how you got here and assume that Poppy came home when you passed out and moved you here.
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<<link [[Next|Flats Poppy Living Room]]>><</link>>

/* ============================================================
   BAILEY EVENT
   ============================================================ */
:: Flats Poppy Bailey
<<endevent>><<npc Poppy>><<person1>><<run markPoppyInteraction()>>
<<effects>><<run poppySchedule()>><<set $outside to 0>>
<<babyRent>>
<<set _rentTotal to ($rentmoney + ($babyRent or 0))>>
<<set _robinTookBackRent to 0>>
<<if robinStandSelfSufficiencyReady() and getRobinLocation() is "orphanage">>
	A knock sounds at the door. Bailey is waiting outside, with Robin just behind <<nnpc_him "Bailey">>, clutching a worn envelope.
	<br><br>
	"Wait," <<nnpc_he "Robin">> says, stepping forward. "You're not taking <<pher>> money for me anymore. I'm paying my own way from now on."
	<br><br>
	Robin holds out the envelope. Bailey counts the notes, then pockets them with a scoff. "Fine. But if you're ever short, I won't be polite about it."
	<br><br>
	<<run robinStandBecomeSelfSufficient()>><<set _rentTotal to ($rentmoney + ($babyRent or 0))>><<set _robinTookBackRent to 1>>
	Robin looks past Bailey and smiles at you. "The stand makes enough now. You don't have to carry me anymore." <span class="green">You no longer pay Robin's share of the rent.</span>
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<if setup.hbsc.canAutoPay("bailey", _rentTotal)>>
	/* HBSC standing order is set up and the savings cover it: settle automatically, mirroring the orphanage rentdue widget so the flat honours the same standing order. */
	<<if not _robinTookBackRent>>You hear a knock at the door. <span class="red">It's Bailey.</span><br><br><</if>>
	<<rentpay "bank">>
	<br><br>
	<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
	<<set $renttime to 7>><<set $rentday to Time.weekDay>>
	<<link [[Next|Flats Poppy Living Room]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<if setup.hbsc.cancelIfShort("bailey", _rentTotal)>>
	<span class="red">Your HBSC standing order couldn't cover the rent, so it's been cancelled.</span><br><br>
<</if>>
<<if T.poppyFlatBaileyHome>>
	<<if not _robinTookBackRent>>
		You hear a knock at the door. Poppy doesn't hesitate to get up and open the door. You follow suit to see who it could be.
		<br><br>
		<span class="red">It's Bailey.</span>
		<br><br>
		<<if !$poppySeen.includes("flat_bailey_intro")>>
			"Poppy." Bailey greets the <<if $awarelevel gte 5>>crimson fox<<else>>crimson haired person<</if>>.
			<br><br>
			"Bailey." Poppy greets back with a smile.
			<br><br>
			"I'm here for my ward." Bailey says as <<nnpc_he "Bailey">> zones in on you. "<<pShe>> <<pverb "owes" "owe">> me. I'm here to collect."
			<<set $poppySeen.push("flat_bailey_intro")>>
		<<else>>
			Bailey looks past Poppy and zones in on you. "Time to pay up," <<nnpc_he "Bailey">> says.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
	<<if T.poppyFlatBaileyLowPatience>>
		Poppy pushes you towards the door until you're standing face to face with Bailey, outside of the flat. "<<pShes>> all yours." <<He>> says to Bailey and closes the door behind you.
		<br><br>
		Bailey folds <<nnpc_his "Bailey">> arms, impatient.<<gstress>><<stress 300>>
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Pay|Flats Poppy Bailey Pay]]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Refuse|Flats Poppy Bailey Refuse]]>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		Poppy turns to you, looking at you expectantly. With the both of them looking at you, you feel pressured.
		<<gstress>><<stress 300>>
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Pay|Flats Poppy Bailey Pay]]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Refuse|Flats Poppy Bailey Refuse]]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<if Number($poppyromance) gte 0>>
			<<link [[Plead Poppy to pay for you|Flats Poppy Bailey Plead]]>><</link>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<if not _robinTookBackRent>>
		You hear a knock at the door. Poppy is not home at the moment so you went to check who it could be on <<his>> behalf.
		<br><br>
		You open the door. <span class="red">It's Bailey.</span>
		<br><br>
		"Time to pay up," <<nnpc_he "Bailey">> says.
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
	<<link [[Pay|Flats Poppy Bailey Pay]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Refuse|Flats Poppy Bailey Refuse]]>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</if>>

:: Flats Poppy Bailey Pay
<<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<run poppySchedule()>><<rentpay>>
<<if $poppyFlat.home>>
	Poppy closes the door. "It's for the best." <<He>> smiles at you sympathetically.
<</if>>
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<<set $renttime to 7>><<set $rentday to Time.weekDay>>
<<link [[Next|Flats Poppy Living Room]]>><</link>>

:: Flats Poppy Bailey Plead
<<effects>><<run poppySchedule()>><<speechresolve>>
<<if random(1,100) lte 50>>
	<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "docile" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek")>>
		You ask Poppy to pay for you in a small, obedient voice, as if bracing for the refusal before it comes.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "confident" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite")>>
		You ask Poppy to pay for you, trying to keep your voice steady under Bailey's stare.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
		You tell Poppy to pay for you before Bailey can drag this out any longer.
	<<else>>
		You plead with Poppy to pay for you.
	<</if>>
	<<He>> seems hesitant about it. Bailey looks at <<him>> as <<he>> ponders.
	<br><br>
	<<set _rentOwed to ($rentmoney + ($babyRent or 0))>>With a sigh, Poppy finally relents and pays the <<printmoney _rentOwed>> you owe to Bailey.
	<<npcincr Poppy love -1>><<llove>><<npcincr Poppy patience -1>><<if C.npc.Poppy.patience gte 0>><<lpatience>><<else>><<ganger>><</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<set $rentmoney to [10000,30000,50000,70000,100000,150000,200000][Math.clamp($rentstage,1,6)]>><<rentmod>>
	Bailey takes the money from Poppy's hand and starts counting. When <<nnpc_hes "Bailey">> done, <<nnpc_he "Bailey">> nods.
	<<if $rentstage is 1>>
		"Next week I want <<printmoney $rentmoney "pink">><<babyRentDisplay " plus " " if you don't look after your children" "pink">>. You didn't think it would get any easier, did you?"
	<<else>>
		"Next week I want <<printmoney $rentmoney "pink">><<babyRentDisplay " plus " " if you don't look after your children" "pink">>."
	<</if>>
	<<set $baileydefeatedchain to 0>><<set $baileyRefusedToPay to 0>><<set $baileypaychain to ($baileypaychain || 0) + 1>>
	<<unset $bailey_encroach>>
	<<set $rentstage += 1>><<set $renttime to 7>><<set $rentday to Time.weekDay>>
	<br><br>
	Bailey turns to leave and Poppy closes the door. "Next time, you should be more responsible for your own personal matters. I can't always be helping you, especially when you put me up on the spot like that."
	<br><br>
	<<He>> looks annoyed but says nothing more on the matter.
	<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
	<<link [[Next|Flats Poppy Living Room]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
		You plead for Poppy to pay for you, the words catching in your throat.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		You ask Poppy to pay for you, looking down before Bailey can enjoy your expression.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
		You ask Poppy to cover the payment for you, trying to keep panic out of your voice.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
		You ask Poppy to pay for you, forcing yourself to sound steadier than you feel.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
		You tell Poppy to pay for you, anger making the request sharper than intended.
	<<else>>
		You plead with Poppy to pay for you.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<He>> shakes <<his>> head. "Sorry, I can't." <<He>> doesn't give you any explanation.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Pay|Flats Poppy Bailey Pay]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Refuse|Flats Poppy Bailey Refuse]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Flats Poppy Bailey Refuse
<<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<run poppySchedule()>><<speechresolve>>
<<set _rentDue to $rentmoney + ($babyRent or 0)>>
<<set $baileypaychain to 0>><<set $baileyRefusedToPayTotal += _rentDue>><<set $baileyRefusedToPayTotalStat += _rentDue>>
<<set $renttime to 7>><<set $rentday to Time.weekDay>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"N-No," you stutter, surprised by your own bravery. "I-I won't."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You clutch the money close. "No! I-I can't give it to you."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	You meet Bailey's stare. "The money isn't yours. I'm keeping it."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	You stare at Bailey in defiance. "I'm not paying you. I don't care what you do to me."
<<else>>
	"The money isn't yours," you say. "I'm keeping it."
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if T.poppyFlatBaileyHome and !T.poppyFlatBaileyLowPatience>>
	Poppy lightly shakes <<his>> head at your defiance.
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<if $robinpaid is 1 and $robinStand?.selfSufficient isnot 1>>
	"Very well," Bailey says. "It seems like Robin will be paying on your behalf." <<nnpc_he "Bailey">> turns to leave.
	<br><br>
	Your heart sinks at the implication.<<stress 300>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<if T.poppyFlatBaileyHome and !T.poppyFlatBaileyLowPatience>>
		"Now a heavier price has to be paid." <<He>> looks a little disappointed in you, but says nothing more. Poppy closes the door.
		<br><br>
	<<elseif T.poppyFlatBaileyHome and T.poppyFlatBaileyLowPatience>>
		Poppy offers no comfort, and no protest. The door remains shut behind you.
		<br><br>
	<<elseif !T.poppyFlatBaileyHome>>
		You stand there for a moment after Bailey leaves, sick with dread over what Robin will have to endure in your place.
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
	<span class="red">Robin will pay the price for your refusal.</span>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Flats Poppy Living Room]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<endevent>>
	<<npc Bailey>><<person1>>Bailey scowls and grabs you by the wrist, yanking you away from Poppy's doorway.
	<br><br>
	<<if T.poppyFlatBaileyHome>>
		"Just so you know, <<he>> won't help you." Bailey's grip tightens. "<<nnpc_He "Poppy">> knows better than to interfere with my work."
	<<else>>
		"No one's going to help you," Bailey says coldly.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	"But that's okay," <<He>> says, smiling. "I've already made arrangements. I don't know what they intend for you, and frankly I don't care." <<He>> produces a hood and length of rope. "Hold still."
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Rent Intro]]>><<set $phase to 0>><<endevent "phaseless">><</link>>
<</if>>
